#: 17cbd045afcb46588af7274ef101a08e
msgid "Performance benchmarking"
msgstr "性能基准测试"

#: 459d5f045c0a40cea7ac7dae07dd5f0e
msgid ""
"Jittor uses ASV 0.6.6 to retain commit-indexed timing and memory results. "
"The suite deliberately uses the current Python environment "
"(`--python=same`): a fresh environment per historical commit would mostly "
"measure Jittor's compile and installation cost rather than steady-state "
"runtime performance."
msgstr ""

#: 301f43f82aa64e538eedf97794efee86
msgid "Cache isolation"
msgstr ""

#: dde0ab5bcbfd476a886c1e6831b3d10a
msgid ""
"ASV and the unit-test suite must never compile into the same Jittor cache. "
"Every benchmark setup validates both variables before importing Jittor:"
msgstr ""

#: 87b0379ea7654d55bb8d7698268786a1
msgid ""
"`cache_name` must begin with `asv-`, and the resolved `JITTOR_HOME` must "
"contain an `asv` path component. A missing or reused cache is a hard error, "
"not an ASV skip. Give parallel CPU, CUDA, and NPU jobs different "
"`JITTOR_HOME` directories or different `cache_name` values."
msgstr ""

#: d81e6a71cfd7421e9b16592eaefec1e6
msgid ""
"Generated ASV state defaults to `.asv/`. CI and nox should set "
"`JITTOR_ASV_HOME`/`JITTOR_HOME` to job-local storage outside the checkout; "
"raw results intended for publication should be uploaded as artifacts."
msgstr ""

#: 4fc157e0ab884bc1abd60634a2543241
msgid "Validate and smoke-test"
msgstr ""

#: 0b8315a39378415182282a38cc960d0f
msgid ""
"Install the performance dependencies and check benchmark signatures without "
"building an ASV environment:"
msgstr ""

#: eefc5d673714433bb6ba25b4c80abf46
msgid ""
"The CPU parameters import and execute without CUDA. CUDA parameters raise an"
" explicit ASV skip when Jittor or real PyTorch cannot execute on CUDA. Real "
"PyTorch is an optional oracle and must be installed separately for the "
"target platform; an absent or shim-resolved `torch` is reported as skipped, "
"never as a zero-duration result. At least one mandatory Jittor CPU case must"
" execute in CI, so a run in which every parameter skips is not acceptable."
msgstr ""

#: 99bd9fd90706401a9e5272a184142e8b
msgid "Record selected revisions"
msgstr ""

#: 21b029731c154dff9f6b97e168760ffd
msgid ""
"Existing environments cannot ask ASV to build an arbitrary history. Run the "
"suite only from a checkout that matches the result label, and record that "
"exact commit:"
msgstr ""

#: 0ebebf90a6034c38bdf6e989bb278865
msgid ""
"For a comparison, create one dedicated benchmark worktree, switch that "
"worktree only to the two or three reviewed revisions, and run the command "
"above after each switch. Keep the same compiler, accelerator, dependency "
"versions, cache warmup policy, and ASV results directory. Do not run `ALL` "
"or an unbounded revision range. Use `asv compare <base> <candidate>` after "
"both selected commits have results."
msgstr ""

